00:13:02,493 --> 00:13:06,321
And with NPA's, neuromorphic processors,

234
00:13:06,321 --> 00:13:10,314
we're seeing a lot more that can happen
way down deep inside the edge.

235
00:13:10,677 --> 00:13:14,307
We're also seeing 5G
and then 6V6G coming up

236
00:13:14,736 --> 00:13:17,475
in the future
where bandwidth will be even greater.

237
00:13:17,475 --> 00:13:19,686
So now that opens up more opportunities

238
00:13:19,686 --> 00:13:23,118
for for me
to even move more stuff at lower latency.

239
00:13:23,580 --> 00:13:28,893
We're seeing some interesting things
with serverless at the edge, where they've

240
